        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Darkness Stirs Once More </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Quest returns with its fourth installment - a turn-based strategy adventure inspired by the legendary HeroQuest board game. Enter a realm of perilous dungeons, cunning traps, and powerful magic as you lead your party of heroes against the forces of the Dark Sorcerer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Gulak, the sorcerer’s puppet, commands monstrous legions that stalk the night. Villagers vanish without a trace - stolen in silence, never to be seen again. Only your band of champions can stand against this tide of darkness and end Gulak’s reign of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/f7bc6b44e7732d0c1ea733cc8fcfb3f7.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=348 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic Dungeon Adventures </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on 30 handcrafted quests filled with tactical, turn-based combat and deadly surprises. Outsmart over 40 unique monsters, evade lethal traps, and wield both magic and steel to survive sprawling, multi-floored dungeons that test your wit and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/beadec3275cf3d61986018f5dd173377.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/beadec3275cf3d61986018f5dd173377.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/beadec3275cf3d61986018f5dd173377.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Your Party of Heroes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to 10 unique heroes, each with distinctive stats and powers. Train them in the Hero Camp, unlock new cards and abilities, and forge your perfect dungeon-delving team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/5c4412a49afb5f67b7036e5d7067004f.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/5c4412a49afb5f67b7036e5d7067004f.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/5c4412a49afb5f67b7036e5d7067004f.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends online or locally in couch co-op up to 3 players, combining your heroes’ strengths to overcome Gulak’s legions. Explore together and find treasures to fill your purses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Creator Mode </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of the Creator - design your own quests, build intricate dungeons, and shape adventures for others to explore. Play, share, and discover community-made quests from players around the world, or craft your own original challenges to test the bravest heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Darkness Stirs Once More </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Quest returns with its fourth installment - a turn-based strategy adventure inspired by the legendary HeroQuest board game. Enter a realm of perilous dungeons, cunning traps, and powerful magic as you lead your party of heroes against the forces of the Dark Sorcerer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil Gulak, the sorcerer’s puppet, commands monstrous legions that stalk the night. Villagers vanish without a trace - stolen in silence, never to be seen again. Only your band of champions can stand against this tide of darkness and end Gulak’s reign of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/f7bc6b44e7732d0c1ea733cc8fcfb3f7.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=348 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic Dungeon Adventures </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on 30 handcrafted quests filled with tactical, turn-based combat and deadly surprises. Outsmart over 40 unique monsters, evade lethal traps, and wield both magic and steel to survive sprawling, multi-floored dungeons that test your wit and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/beadec3275cf3d61986018f5dd173377.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/beadec3275cf3d61986018f5dd173377.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/beadec3275cf3d61986018f5dd173377.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Your Party of Heroes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command up to 10 unique heroes, each with distinctive stats and powers. Train them in the Hero Camp, unlock new cards and abilities, and forge your perfect dungeon-delving team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/5c4412a49afb5f67b7036e5d7067004f.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/5c4412a49afb5f67b7036e5d7067004f.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/5c4412a49afb5f67b7036e5d7067004f.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends online or locally in couch co-op up to 3 players, combining your heroes’ strengths to overcome Gulak’s legions. Explore together and find treasures to fill your purses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/8c729bb7ae68e31d64cc2eae0bf27446.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Creator Mode </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of the Creator - design your own quests, build intricate dungeons, and shape adventures for others to explore. Play, share, and discover community-made quests from players around the world, or craft your own original challenges to test the bravest heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.poster.avif?t=1766179713\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.webm?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453840/extras/9f71e8b38ac1bc5a5cc037f8f6618900.mp4?t=1766179713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
